## Model card

- **Name:** DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
- **Short description:** DeepSeek's MIT-licensed 552B multimodal MoE for input-heavy agentic workloads, with 1M context, 384K output and strong terminal-bench results.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash` — see meta.json
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 per vendor docs; knowledge cutoff 2026-03
- **IDs:** `deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash`
- **Context window:** 1M / 384K out
- **Modalities:** Text, image in; text out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** Paid $0.35/$1.38 per 1M (open-weight cheap) — note: Paid $0.30/$1.20 per 1M (no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

