### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 85/100.** Evidence TB2.1 ~84% via deepseek harness; GDPval ~1400; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 85/100.** Evidence GPQA 84%+; HLE 30%+; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 98/100.** 1M / 384K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 70/100.** Text, image in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 88/100.** Evidence LiveCodeBench ~86%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 65/100.** Paid $0.35/$1.38 per 1M (open-weight cheap).
- **Overall Score: 85/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (85+85+98+70+88)/5=85.2 → 85; best-fit per scoring methodology.

